            "sha256": "725546c581613bc9decd708271dd57af69d0a95d8721507f0986ba77eb6a885a",
            "start": 1029,
            "end": 1088,
            "quote": "Compute Sanitizer is installed as part of the CUDA toolkit.",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-10",
            "event_id": "call_92321c9e2700444386538e11.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "725546c581613bc9decd708271dd57af69d0a95d8721507f0986ba77eb6a885a",
            "start": 786,
            "end": 907,
            "quote": "The PTX compiler and compute-sanitizer must be from the same CUDA toolkit version for compile-time patching with memcheck",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-11",
            "event_id": "call_137b6813a5a94ce5b644ea94.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "77978e6d946317161f4b19e6bef704df3fc5a178044729de7aed79323c289202",
            "start": 455,
            "end": 468,
            "quote": "调试cuda程序 - 知乎",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-12",
            "event_id": "call_137b6813a5a94ce5b644ea94.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "77978e6d946317161f4b19e6bef704df3fc5a178044729de7aed79323c289202",
            "start": 1139,
            "end": 1178,
            "quote": "Compute Sanitizer - NERSC Documentation",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-13",
            "event_id": "call_a8e9d8b56de74b03b44a5576.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "9e2e22727dcca6aaf0ec932594bf1a3719a258cdb19867f1eb0cf34a9696de7b",
            "start": 828,
            "end": 870,
            "quote": "cuda-memcheck/compute-sanitizer工具使用-CSDN博客",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-14",
            "event_id": "call_4a51c74d297c4b3eab677377.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "ae99b6c0d2c46cfd297fc063f3bafde34473c3573043f07c434810d46441df12",
            "start": 107,
            "end": 142,
            "quote": "CUDA内存访问越界？手把手教你用cuda-memcheck和 ...",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-15",
            "event_id": "call_137b6813a5a94ce5b644ea94.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "77978e6d946317161f4b19e6bef704df3fc5a178044729de7aed79323c289202",
            "start": 615,
            "end": 663,
            "quote": "代替以前的 cuda-memcheck （自12.0开始，已经从CUDA Toolkit中移除）",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-16",
            "event_id": "call_137b6813a5a94ce5b644ea94.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "77978e6d946317161f4b19e6bef704df3fc5a178044729de7aed79323c289202",
            "start": 1248,
            "end": 1300,
            "quote": "Compute Sanitizer, previously known as CUDA-MEMCHECK",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-17",
            "event_id": "call_a8e9d8b56de74b03b44a5576.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "9e2e22727dcca6aaf0ec932594bf1a3719a258cdb19867f1eb0cf34a9696de7b",
            "start": 945,
            "end": 983,
            "quote": "此 工具已在 CUDA 11.6 中被弃用，并在12.0 及更高版本中被删除",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-18",
            "event_id": "call_b132f10f3b494eb2bb875eb9.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "2577a2ee939455b73d616a1256b7542da48998076f3cbdd1674dcedb80a39da1",
            "start": 71,
            "end": 158,
            "quote": "No statement about cuda-memcheck/CUDA-MEMCHECK being deprecated exists in this document",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-19",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "bb359d1d04ce52f367c0bedf3e76fb1b6b47902cbacd889ac4a784a75d7ad418",
            "start": 426,
            "end": 467,
            "quote": "compute-sanitizer --tool memcheck ./myApp",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-20",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "bb359d1d04ce52f367c0bedf3e76fb1b6b47902cbacd889ac4a784a75d7ad418",
            "start": 581,
            "end": 651,
            "quote": "编译 kernel 时加源码行信息，即 nvcc 加 `-lineinfo`（轻量，不影响优化）或 `-G`（完整调试信息，会显著降低性能）",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-21",
            "event_id": "call_4c566c377bf4490a913a258b.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "2f880f4a19aa7e02cad1d54ff1c7f30cddfa57875eb9b5f0db03d5f2e3840fd2",
            "start": 838,
            "end": 910,
            "quote": "It can also be explicitly enabled by using the `--tool memcheck` option.",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-22",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "4e9753f77ab9dad0e227dc23d2c1eb9b6f79f8244d2013e10ee488a21a03c61d",
            "start": 72,
            "end": 133,
            "quote": "`cuda-memcheck` 已从 CUDA 12.0 移除，官方替代品是 **Compute Sanitizer**。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-23",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "4e9753f77ab9dad0e227dc23d2c1eb9b6f79f8244d2013e10ee488a21a03c61d",
            "start": 3880,
            "end": 3924,
            "quote": "compute-sanitizer 首次随哪个 CUDA 版本引入，本轮未取得官方原文。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-24",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "4e9753f77ab9dad0e227dc23d2c1eb9b6f79f8244d2013e10ee488a21a03c61d",
            "start": 609,
            "end": 657,
            "quote": "nvcc -Xcompiler -rdynamic -lineinfo -o out in.cu",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-25",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "4e9753f77ab9dad0e227dc23d2c1eb9b6f79f8244d2013e10ee488a21a03c61d",
            "start": 1155,
            "end": 1194,
            "quote": "compute-sanitizer --tool memcheck ./out",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-26",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "4e9753f77ab9dad0e227dc23d2c1eb9b6f79f8244d2013e10ee488a21a03c61d",
            "start": 733,
            "end": 814,
            "quote": "`-Xcompiler -rdynamic`：保留 host 函数符号，使 host backtrace 显示函数名（Linux；Windows 用 `/Zi`）",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-27",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "4e9753f77ab9dad0e227dc23d2c1eb9b6f79f8244d2013e10ee488a21a03c61d",
            "start": 522,
            "end": 598,
            "quote": "工具本身不需要特殊编译旗标就能运行，但要定位到**源码行**，必须加 `-lineinfo`（不影响优化，推荐）或 `-G`（完整调试信息，性能开销大）",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-28",
            "event_id": "call_4c566c377bf4490a913a258b.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "2f880f4a19aa7e02cad1d54ff1c7f30cddfa57875eb9b5f0db03d5f2e3840fd2",
            "start": 1775,
            "end": 2082,
            "quote": "To generate line number information for applications without affecting the optimization level of the output, the `-lineinfo` nvcc option can be used. The Compute Sanitizer tools fully support both of these options and can display source attribution of errors for applications compiled with line information.",
            "json_escaped": false
          }
        ],
